-Selected saved-prediction verification conducted on 25 November 2026 examines numerical consistency using the retained fitted-model outputs. For the REASSEMBLE F2 investigation, the verification examines prediction identities, branch-score parity within the available records, fold assignments, fitted coefficients, and the corresponding ranking metrics. For ViFailback, the verification examines the available saved assessment vectors, metric consistency, and completion records associated with the extended reporting boundary. These checks do not reproduce the original neural fitting procedures or establish independent experimental replication.
